{"2911280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Master of Love", "steam_appid": 2911280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/2be77c7664c1339b5912f73d74721335.avif?t=1728527361\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras_big/2be77c7664c1339b5912f73d74721335.avif?t=1728527361 width=800 height=258 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Subreddit</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/1b4d2137f95c41ebb7c47b0bec5d7617.avif?t=1728527361\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras_big/1b4d2137f95c41ebb7c47b0bec5d7617.avif?t=1728527361 width=800 height=258 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.poster.avif?t=1728527361\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.webm?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.mp4?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failure at both love and career, Jun-Ho takes a bite of his 33rd birthday cake – and finds himself transported ten years into the past. This time around, can he get things right with at least one ex-girlfriend? Romance each old flame, make choices, and unlock different endings with: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runa:</strong> An innocent artist and his first love. A single misunderstanding led to their breakup. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri:</strong> The girl next door who gave Jun-Ho unconditional love. Unfortunately, she always viewed him as a brother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hana:</strong> Jun-Ho’s colleague and secret office romance. Ambition and sabotage brought things to an end. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rahee: </strong>Dated Jun-Ho both before and after her big break into modeling. A public scandal ended their secret relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yiso:</strong> A successful career woman working at the same company as Jun-Ho. Business problems led to their downfall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Experience:</strong> Unlike many Full Motion Video (FMV) games, Master of Love is told through a first-person perspective – unlocking the ultimate K-drama experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Driven:</strong> Make choices in life and love to unlock five unique endings – each moving in their own way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6+ hours of playtime:</strong> Immerse yourself in a detailed fantasy indistinguishable from real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Videos: </strong>Get to know the charming actors behind<i> Master of Love.</i></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.poster.avif?t=1728527361\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.webm?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911280/extras/6b0a51de39faacc522552a29df0cf6f7.mp4?t=1728527361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failure at both love and career, Jun-Ho takes a bite of his 33rd birthday cake – and finds himself transported ten years into the past. This time around, can he get things right with at least one ex-girlfriend? Romance each old flame, make choices, and unlock different endings with: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runa:</strong> An innocent artist and his first love. A single misunderstanding led to their breakup. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri:</strong> The girl next door who gave Jun-Ho unconditional love. Unfortunately, she always viewed him as a brother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hana:</strong> Jun-Ho’s colleague and secret office romance. Ambition and sabotage brought things to an end. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rahee: </strong>Dated Jun-Ho both before and after her big break into modeling. A public scandal ended their secret relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yiso:</strong> A successful career woman working at the same company as Jun-Ho. Business problems led to their downfall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Experience:</strong> Unlike many Full Motion Video (FMV) games, Master of Love is told through a first-person perspective – unlocking the ultimate K-drama experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Driven:<